<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/ai-tool-model-hot/</link><description>每天从 10 个信源收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:13:40 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 上线 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available</link><description>Copilot 即日起可用 OpenAI 的 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol，两款模型面向智能体编程与代码评审，编码判断力比上一代更强。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96ff71f54c6e7b4da47668acaa4a513b0085cd1a</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol</link><description>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 在专业输出、编程、电脑操作与成本效率上都有提升，已覆盖 ChatGPT Work、Codex 与 API。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">549a77347d5e1e5f25e081258d641a2b8758c868</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 更新</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>这版主要是体验修补：装 GitHub 应用前多一道确认，/status 能列出失效的配置，/config 会提示被覆盖的设置，MCP 加了从标准输入读 JSON 的方式。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>让 Gemini 为你干活</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/tasks-in-gemini-free-new-features</link><description>Gemini 应用上线免费任务功能，把想办的事交给它，它会在后台替你推进。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cb1d8f8bc84f7e6afbd259b401364decf6841b22</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/tasks-in-gemini-free-new-features">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot Fusion 扩展：新模型、更多入口与基准成绩</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-fusion-updates-more-availability-benchmarks-and-models</link><description>Copilot Fusion 增加了新模型、覆盖了更多 Copilot 入口，还公布了两份 Terminal-Bench 公开榜单成绩，方便用户选用与横向比较。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:04:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">08a8dbd9f09af5b3a4c178912de142cc1667d198</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-fusion-updates-more-availability-benchmarks-and-models">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot 应用更新：支持 Azure DevOps 与企业版 Server</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-app-microsoft-ignite-releases</link><description>Copilot 应用现在能接 Azure DevOps 仓库、GitHub Enterprise Server 实例，还能在浏览器里用，走到用户干活的地方去。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:03:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0fb6d41b1c23d94f5d1f27772feaf7c313b07988</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-app-microsoft-ignite-releases">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>JetBrains 版 Copilot 更新：远程访问与端侧语音输入</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-in-jetbrains-ignite-releases</link><description>JetBrains 里的 Copilot 新增远程访问、设备端语音听写和浏览器使用控制，还有上下文用量快捷方式与历史差异对比。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">16585d72ac903443120b9e0cd31ebffc48669ef9</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-in-jetbrains-ignite-releases">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Copilot 智能体活动可接入 Microsoft Agent 365 监控</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-monitor-github-copilot-activity-through-microsoft-agent-365</link><description>企业现在能把各 Copilot 客户端的智能体活动直接推送到 Microsoft Agent 365，在微软的智能体管控平面里统一审计。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f7d1e15580c30d5475426e0b5c9e181d61e9bef0</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-monitor-github-copilot-activity-through-microsoft-agent-365">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>GitHub Copilot Evals 公开预览：给 Copilot 做评测调优</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-evals-is-now-in-public-preview</link><description>Copilot Evals 进入公开预览：提示词、模型、技能或工具变了之后，可以用它检验 Copilot 是不是还在最佳状态。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b90807377a92d888efb0c2284fe1d56f6fdbdc3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-evals-is-now-in-public-preview">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>ChatGPT 医疗版再升级：电脑操作智能体与新插件</title><link>https://openai.com/index/more-ways-to-move-care-forward-with-chatgpt-for-healthcare</link><description>新版本加入能操作电脑的智能体、更准确的临床回答和一批医疗软件插件，让 ChatGPT 能在医疗流程里干实活。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cfcc7acb02e9ca7944d1e900e1dedbf4b8c78667</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/more-ways-to-move-care-forward-with-chatgpt-for-healthcare">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>构建主动式智能体的经验谈</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/what-weve-learned-building-proactive-agents</link><description>LangChain 复盘 GTM Agent 与 Robin 的开发经验：主动式智能体自行推进目标、只在需要时向人确认，记忆与交互体验是成败关键。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:49:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">226d5fe68e915d58be26db8ab0d2dab1b59e0d7c</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/what-weve-learned-building-proactive-agents">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith 新增追踪数据敏感信息保护控制</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/protect-sensitive-data-in-your-traces-new-controls-in-langsmith</link><description>LangSmith 上线新的访问控制，帮助团队管好追踪数据里的敏感信息，让不同成员只能看到自己权限范围内的内容。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">207b91be1156ef2eb2a3d3652a8381b63b4fdeb4</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/protect-sensitive-data-in-your-traces-new-controls-in-langsmith">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT for Sales，面向销售团队的新插件</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-for-sales</link><description>ChatGPT 新增面向销售场景的插件，并接入 30 多个新增与扩展的合作方插件，帮助销售团队调研客户、准备推介、同步客户关系数据并推进成交。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c6c361c53bc4ce2d407e4ebf6ba55c1f510e586f</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-for-sales">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Copilot 代码评审升级：自适应深度与密钥检测</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-copilot-code-review-adaptive-effort-secret-detection-and-more</link><description>Copilot 代码评审新增自适应评审深度：常规改动快速过一遍，复杂改动再深挖，还能检测泄露的密钥。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:02:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d463ce80860760b92525c154a5e2fde979fbbeb9</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-copilot-code-review-adaptive-effort-secret-detection-and-more">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>微软 MAI Code 2 与 MAI Code 2 Flash 上线 Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-mai-code-2-and-mai-code-2-flash-in-github-copilot</link><description>微软新一代 AI 编程模型 MAI Code 2 与轻量版 MAI Code 2 Flash 正式进入 Copilot。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:01:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1fae7e83ee21808fafd0ae199ecaae864baf0ce6</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-mai-code-2-and-mai-code-2-flash-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Copilot CLI 预览支持 Microsoft Entra 登录</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview</link><description>Copilot 命令行工具开始公开预览 Microsoft Entra 登录，用微软账号即可静默认证关联的企业托管用户。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2217122441a2dd3767514458a43053f3da238975</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-github-copilot-cli-adds-microsoft-entra-sign-in-as-a-preview">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Copilot 代码评审效果可在仓库洞察里查看</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-track-copilot-code-review-outcomes-in-repository-insights</link><description>仓库新增洞察页面，可以看到 Copilot 代码评审的反馈在各个仓库里的实际采纳情况。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:00:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3549b02ad48bb4a069fb5c3cc964947c33abf31c</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-track-copilot-code-review-outcomes-in-repository-insights">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Devin 推出 Devin Bots：为目标负责的工程队友</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots</link><description>Devin Bots 是能为目标负责的工程队友，可以带领一组 Devin 去交付成果。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">053a7a9d8ca5a8c12607b3d6e73dfbed9fd20802</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 扩大面向科学家的 AI 使用权限</title><link>https://openai.com/index/expanding-chatgpt-for-academic-researchers</link><description>OpenAI 扩展了 ChatGPT 学术研究者计划，将向全球 20 万名研究人员免费开放其前沿模型。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f26f2a4dfd6b9b957c1544d02f570339b8f668d2</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/expanding-chatgpt-for-academic-researchers">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>前沿科学：1800 多位科学家怎么用 ChatGPT 做研究</title><link>https://openai.com/index/science-at-the-frontier</link><description>OpenAI 调查了 1800 多位科学家的日常用法，展示 AI 如何改变研究流程、效率和对发现的期待。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f891bd93f3d21469060271c5a85b2a7a2e8b4138</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/science-at-the-frontier">OpenAI News</source></item></channel></rss>
